## Test results and coverage
# `dotnet test --results-directory artifacts/test-results` writes TRX and Cobertura here, and the
# tools under tools/Napkin.Tools read them back. Everything under artifacts/ is reproducible.
artifacts/
TestResults/
*.trx
coverage.cobertura.xml
coverage.opencover.xml
coverage.json

# ...except the captured toolchain output the tools are tested against, which is source.
!tests/Napkin.Tools.Tests/Fixtures/*.trx

## Avalonia/local publish output
publish/

## The MLX bridge (docs/design/mlx-runtime.md §1.3): tools/scripts/build-mlx.sh writes the dylib,
## the metallib and the spike into out/; xcodebuild keeps DerivedData in .derived/ and its
## package workspace in .swiftpm/. Package.resolved is source and stays committed.
native/NapkinMlx/out/
native/NapkinMlx/.derived/
native/NapkinMlx/.swiftpm/
native/NapkinMlx/.build/
